# Banter in The Crooked Nightmare (story/banter.gd plays this file only where a place's region is crooked_nightmare): one exchange between two or three companions about what is in
# front of them in one place, gated on that place (`at:`) and on the story's state so a remark never runs ahead of the chapter. Played now and then on entering
# an area, once each; an exchange nobody present can speak comes out empty and is skipped.
# Drafted by Gemini (docs/plans/gemini_companions/), edited; every edit is listed in the README there. Lines are unvoiced until the voice lane reads them.


~ nm_estate_01_rook_delphine
if name:rook_coldwake and name:delphine_ravelle and at:nm_estate and not flag.nm_chapter_done
interject name:rook_coldwake: We signed that house off as level, Delphine, and now the gables are forty degrees out of regulation and weeping purple muck onto the porch. Settle down now, I am writing a second citation.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Save your chalk, when a house bends on the bias and flashes red for the cheap seats, it is staging a revival, not asking for a mason.
interject name:rook_coldwake: A revival still needs proper drainage round the well, and my brass knocker has not stopped clacking since we passed the broken signpost.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Your Foolishness just tried to rhyme clapboard with encore, Rook, which is frankly more offensive than the screaming behind that door.
interject name:rook_coldwake: Put a thumb in my ribs if I forget to breathe before the porch steps. I hate clearing the same docket twice.
endif
-> END

~ nm_dark_wood_02_tobin_silas
if name:tobin_hayward and name:silas_vane and at:nm_dark_wood and not flag.nm_chapter_done
interject name:tobin_hayward: Beech, ash and hickory, Silas, and the leaf litter tastes of chalk and cold knuckles. Someone has been slapping white handprints up the bark like a lunatic marking rows for felling.
interject name:silas_vane: Tell's in the twitch, friend, and those little prints are dealing straight toward that crooked door in the leaves. Somebody stacked this wood for a very small player.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Look at the bite taken out of that stump, clean through the heartwood. Whatever chewed it did not care for the grain.
interject name:silas_vane: My shadow is lagging a full stride back under this blank moon, Tobin, and it does not rattle unless the house is palming a nasty card.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Keep your bone cards in your fist and walk by the turnip light, then. We will see what is waiting in the clearing before the damp gets in my stitches.
endif
-> END

~ nm_wedding_03_delphine_lucan
if name:delphine_ravelle and name:lucan_houndstooth and at:nm_wedding and not flag.nm_chapter_done
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Now that is proper billing, Lucan, animal masks in the dance ring and a black goat sharing the dais with the bride. In Picco we charged two silver extra for livestock in the ceremony.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: The choreography is lively, Delphine, though the gentleman in the mask by the pole has not shifted his posture in ten minutes. I can only award the catering a three, as half the long table is raw offal.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Mind the seams, darling, if that goat starts taking vows, I am stealing the rose crown for my lining.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: Barnaby is tucking his tail behind my boots, and there is not a cloud of thunder in this moonless sky.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Keep your hand on his collar and your yellow eyes on the lanterns, Lucan. Nobody sets a feast this big unless they expect the guests to stay on the platter.
endif
-> END

~ nm_oven_04_cordelia_tobin
if name:cordelia_skein and name:tobin_hayward and at:nm_oven and not flag.nm_chapter_done
interject name:cordelia_skein: Fascinating pathology, Tobin, the thermal ratio inside this firebrick chamber could render a specimen down to tallow in twelve minutes flat. Do look at the size of that iron wheel.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Keep three paces between me and the grate, Cordelia, I am dry straw from collar to heel and the draught is already curling my cuffs. Even the mice in my lapels have gone still.
interject name:cordelia_skein: Do hold still, darling, I can spin a thin silk screen across your burlap if the heat presses too hard on your eyes.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Save your thread for the woman chained to that top spit, before the crank turns her over the coals alongside that ugly roasting bird.
interject name:cordelia_skein: My vials are beginning to simmer against my thorax, Tobin, and if my humours boil over, neither of us will remember how to work a lock.
endif
-> END

~ nm_bookshelf_05_rook_lucan
if name:rook_coldwake and name:lucan_houndstooth and at:nm_bookshelf and not flag.nm_chapter_done
interject name:rook_coldwake: This plank has no proper parapet, Lucan, and the dust is lying two inches thick like Syndramas snow. One bad step off the edge and that cat takes us off the shift log.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: Hush now, the dark has teeth, and at our present scale those teeth are the size of churchwarden spades. I must grade the feline an eight for vigilance, though its nose needs wiping.
interject name:rook_coldwake: Never mind the cat, there is a fellow up to his waist in a liquor decanter the height of a watchtower, and zero drainage on the glass.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: The bouquet coming off that stopper is three-quarters cheap brandy and one-quarter pure terror, Rook, and Barnaby is barking at the book spines like a terrier at a wall.
interject name:rook_coldwake: Keep the little hound off the spilled spirits and mind the turf along the bindings. My fingers are soft enough without climbing wet leather.
endif
-> END

~ nm_attic_06_tobin_delphine
if name:tobin_hayward and name:delphine_ravelle and at:nm_attic and not flag.nm_chapter_done
interject name:tobin_hayward: Hold still, you're fraying on the stair nail, Delphine, and I will not have centipedes nesting in your hem before we reach the rafters. That whole wall is one living pelt of vermin.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Do not fuss over my stitches, Tobin, look at the state of the house, feathers in the cobwebs and a clawed pot boiling in a seven-pointed star. Whoever dressed this attic had a very loud third act.
interject name:tobin_hayward: They had fifty years of sour ritual soaked into the floorboards, more like, and my head is itching with beetles just looking at those gnawed bones.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: He says the rocking chair is waiting for an encore, darling, and he is not even making a pun about the crib.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Stay three paces back from the cauldron fire and step round the chalk sigils, girl. Some rot you do not scrape with a boot.
endif
-> END

~ nm_crater_07_tobin_lucan
if name:tobin_hayward and name:lucan_houndstooth and at:nm_crater and not flag.nm_chapter_done
interject name:tobin_hayward: I just put a pinch of this crater ash on my tongue, Lucan, and it has no earth in it at all. It tastes like cold iron and colours a turnip never grew under.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: Prime specimen of a pit, Tobin, though the spoor around the rim is burnt completely flat. Look across the bay at those thousands of little lamps, all stacked up without a single chimney smoking.
interject name:tobin_hayward: I used to say the soil never lies, yet this seven-foot stone fell straight out of the sky and scorched the taproots into glass.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: Barnaby will not go near that strange bench, if you please, and the hair along my own neck is rising at the hum of that pulsing rock.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Keep your nose out of the furrow, then, and let us see to the girl on the rim before the light gets into our seams.
endif
-> END

~ nm_estate_ruins_08_silas_delphine
if name:silas_vane and name:delphine_ravelle and at:nm_estate_ruins and flag.crooked_house_destroyed
interject name:silas_vane: House always wins, unless you burn the house, Delphine, and this one folded all the way down to the cellar. Look at those spirits spinning out of the plaster like sparks off a wheel.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Curtain down, and not a single rafter left to hang a velvet drape from. Even Your Foolishness has gone quiet over my shoulder, and he usually loves a collapsing set.
interject name:silas_vane: That is a clean sky above the dead tree, friend, real stars and no old crone squinting down at my tally marks. Makes a fellow's ribs feel light.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: There is not even a brass button in the dust worth pocketing, Silas, just broken timber and a little girl standing by the porch steps.
interject name:silas_vane: Leave the trinkets in the dirt and pocket your needle. When the table clears this clean, you take your winnings and walk out the open gate.
endif
-> END
